    "media:imagetext": "Flight Attendant Celebration Day at SFO\nTuesday, August 20th 10:00 a.m. to 3:00 p.m.\nSan Francisco Airport Commission Aviation Library and Louis A. Turpen Aviation Museum\nInternational Terminal - Level 3 San Francisco International Airport\nlease join us for an open house celebrating Flight Attendants of the past and the\npresent from all air carriers. A program of talks, short subject films, and commemoration:\nvill be presented throughout the day, and featuring the current museum exhibitio\nUnited We Stand: Female Flight Attendant Uniforms of United Airlines.\nor program information and directions, please visit: www.rafa-cwa.org or www.SFOMuseum.ore\n•omplimentary refreshments, and Airport parking garage tickets will be validated at the museum\nThis event is open to the public free of charge.\nParticipating Partners\nRetiree Association of Flight Attendants-CWA (RAFA)\nAssociation of Flight Attendants-CWA (AFA)\nUnited Airlines Historical Foundation (UAHF)\n•--",
